000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CRSPRT.
000400 AUTHOR.              BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        JULY 12, 1985.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*     THIS PROGRAM DOES THE ACTUAL PRINTING OF A RECEIVING SLIP.
001100*************************************************************
001200*************************************************************
001300**                      C R S P R T                        **
001400**                                                         **
001500*D    THIS PROGRAM RETRIEVES THE DATA FOR A RECEIVING SLIP **
001600*D    NUMBER FROM THE DATABASE AND PRINTS IT TO THE        **
001700*D    PRINTERS FOUND IN THE SPOOLFILE FILE FOR THAT USER.  **
001800**                                                         **
001900**    THERE ARE SOME DIFFERENCES BETWEEN THE RECEIVING     **
002000**    SLIP PRINTED FROM A REPRINT REQUEST AND THE          **
002100**    RECEIVING SLIP PRINTED AT CREATION TIME.             **
002200**          1.  NO RECEIVED UM IS PRINTED ON REPRINT.      **
002300**              (NOT STORED IN DATABASE)                   **
002400**          2.  NO FREIGHT COMMENT FIELD IS PRINTED        **
002500**              ON REPRINT. (NOT STORED IN DATABASE)       **
      **          #2 NO LONGER APPLIES WITH RLSE H0100 (JSB)     **
002600**                                                         **
002700*************************************************************
002800*************************************************************
002900**   CALLING ROUTINES:                                     **
003000**          1.  SRSPRTS  - RECEIVING SLIP REPRINT          **
003100**          2.  SRCVEXEC - RECEIVER CREATE PROGRAM        **
003200*************************************************************
003300*************************************************************.
003400*************************************************************
003500*************************************************************
003600*   PASSED PARAMETERS:   (NOT INCLUSIVE OR IN ORDER)        *
003700*     1.  BASE   X(10)                                      *
003800*                DATABASE NAME (STORES)                     *
003900*                                                           *
004000*     3.  PASS-PGM-NAME   X(8)                              *
004100*                PASSED SO BLOWUP PROGRAM CAN SHOW THE      *
004200*                CALLING PROGRAM NAME.                      *
004300*                                                           *
004400*     4.  PASS-PRINT-DEPT X(4)                              *
004500*                AKRON ONLY - EACH SIGNON DOCK HAS ITS OWN  *
004600*                PRINT DEPARTMENT.                          *
004700*                                                           *
004800*     5.  MISC-FRT-COMMENT    X(68)                             *
004900*                OSD COMMENT FROM FREIGHT SCREEN NEEDS TO   *
005000*                BE PASSED BECAUSE ITS NOT STORED IN DB.    *
005100*                                                           *
005200*     6.  MISC-RS-ARG          X(14)                             *
005300*                RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER TO BE PRINTED        *
005400*                                                           *
005500*     7.  SPOOL-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP                        *
005600*         ACCTG-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP                        *
005700*         PRINT-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP                        *
005800*                SPOOLED PRINTER NUMBERS FOR PRINT OUT.     *
005900*                SPOOL-PRT-NO IS REQUIRED, OTHERS AREN'T.   *
006000*                                                           *
006100*     8.  PLT-NUMBER    X(3)                              *
006200*                PLANT NUMBER FOR SPECIAL LOGICS.           *
006300*                                                           *
006400*     9.  PRINT-PRICE-SW  X(1)                            *
006500*                "Y" IF AKRON'S CORDER PO HAS A DIFFERENT   *
006600*                PRICE UM FROM ORDERED UM. NEED TO PRINT    *
006700*                PRICE UM IN THAT CASE.                     *
006800*                                                           *
006900*    10.  PASS-ITEM-TABLE.           OCCURS 12 TIMES.       *
007000*           A)  PASS-ITEM      - ITEM NUMBER ON RCVING SLIP *
007100*           B)  PASS-DLV-UM    - CODED DELIVERED UM         *
007200*           C)  PASS-PRICE-QTY -                            *
007300*           D)  PASS-PRICE-UM  - CERTAIN RECEIVING DEPTS    *
007400*                                NEED TO SHOW UNIT PRICES.  *
007500*         THE ABOVE TABLE IS ONLY FILLED IN WHEN CREATING   *
007600*         A RECEIVIER, NOT WHEN PROCESSING A REPRINT.       *
007700*                                                           *
007800*    11.  VIEW-COMAREA - SO BLOWUP PROGRAM CAN ABORT        *
003900*                                                           *
003700*    12.  BASE-MMISA X(24)                                  *
003800*                DATABASE NAME (MMISA)                      *
007900*************************************************************
008000*C***********************************************************
      *C MAY 21, 1992  - J.S. BUNGO   (005979)                    *
      *C   MADE A DATABASE CALL TO PER-PERSONNEL IN THE MMISA     *
      *C   DATABASE TO RETRIEVE AND PRINT THE ORIGINATOR NAME     *
      *C   WITH THE CLOCK CARD NUMBER FOR PO'S FROM MMIS WITH     *
      *C   A REQUISTION.                                          *
      *C
      *C 09/19/94    JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADDED A LINE TO THE RECEIVING SLIP TO PRINT A CHAT
      *C   NUMBER AND ITS MFR AND TRADE NAME IF A CHAT NUMBER WAS
      *C   REFERENCED ON AN ITEM ON THE RECEIVING SLIP.
      *C
      *C 06/06/96    JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPANDED DATES FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILED TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C 10/22/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADD CAST, CIRC, CIRM, AND DES TO LIST OF RECEIVING
      *C   DEPARTMENTS TO PRINT PRICE INFORMATION.
      *C
      *C 10/31/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADDED PRINTING OF RECEIVING INSTRUCTIONS FOR BEFORE
      *C   AND AFTER ALL ITEMS AS WELL AS ITEM INSTRUCTIONS.
      *C
      *C 05/22/97  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADDED "END OF RECEIVER" PRINT TEXT AT THE END OF
      *C   THE RECEIVING SLIP PRINT.
      *C
      *C 01/26/99  CA YODER
      *C   IF A NON-CODED RCVG SLIP WAS PRINTED AFTER ONE WITH
      *C   CODED ITEMS WHICH INCLUDES CHAT NUMBERS, THE CHAT
      *C   DESCRIPTION WAS CARRIED OVER TO THE NEXT RCVG SLIP.
      *C   CORRECTED LOGIC TO ELIMINATE THE PRINTING ERROR.
      *C
      *C 03/24/98  JIM COFFMAN
      *C   ADD CIRA AND CIRO TO LIST OF RECEIVING
      *C   DEPARTMENTS TO PRINT PRICE INFORMATION.
      *C
      *C 12/06/00  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK ORIGINATOR FIELD ON PRT-REQ-LINE
      *C   TO SEE IF LINE SHOULD BE PRINTED.
      *C
      *C 03/14/02  CA YODER        (NAPANEE REQUEST)
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT COMMENTS FROM MCFPCS7000 ON RECEIVING
      *C   SLIP, IF THE FILE EXISTS.
      *C
      *C 01/28/2003  DAN RAUCH   DCR01
      *C   CORRECT PRINTING OF "NOTIFY"  - INIT MREQ PRIOR TO READ
      *C
      *C***********************************************************
