065100     02  COUNT-ITEM OCCURS 999 TIMES     PIC X.
064400 COPY ESCNAME OF COPYLIB.
065200*************************************************************
065300*************************************************************'
065400*                   MAIN PARAGRAGH                          *
065500*     RETRIEVE HEADER AND FREIGHT INFORMATION FOR RECEIVER  *
065600*     AND THEN DETERMINE IF  RECEIVER IS CODED OR NONCODED. *
065700*     READ THROUGH EACH RECEIVER'S ITEMS TO DETERMINE HOW   *
065800*     MANY PAGES THE PRINTOUT WILL BE, AND THEN START OVER  *
065900*     AND PRINT THE SECOND TIME THROUGH THE ITEMS.          *
066000*                                                           *
066100*     RECEIVING SLIP REPRINT WILL NOT HAVE FREIGHT OSD      *
066200*     COMMENTS PRINTED OR HAVE CODED RECEIVING UM PRINTED.  *
066300*     THESE ITEMS ARE NOT STORED IN THE DATABASE.  THEY     *
066400*     ARE PASSED PARAMETERS WHEN A RECEIVER IS CREATED.     *
066500*     IF AKRON AND IF A C-ORDER HAS A DIFFERENT ORDERED UM  *
066600*     FROM THE DELIVERED UM, THE PRICE DATA IS PASSED       *
066700*     WHEN A RECEIVER IS CREATED, BUT NOT FOR A REPRINT.    *
066800*************************************************************
066900*************************************************************
067000 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE-MMISA MISCELLANEOUS-DATA
067100                    RCVR-PRINT-PARAMETERS RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS
067200                    VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS, COUNT-AREA,
067300                    ESC-NAME.
067400 00-PRINT SECTION 00.
067500 00-SRSPRT-MAIN.
           MOVE ZEROES TO PG-NO.
           MOVE SPACES TO DISP-FRT-PO, DISP-FRT-RLSE, DISP-FRT-RS.
067600     IF MISC-REPRINT = "Y"
067700        MOVE "R C V  S L I P  R E P R I N T"  TO HDR1-TITLE
067800     ELSE
067900        MOVE "  R E C E I V I N G  S L I P  " TO HDR1-TITLE.
068000     MOVE CHAR-1636PI TO STRIP.
068100     MOVE STRIP       TO COMPRESS-1-1
068200                         COMPRESS-1-2
068300                         COMPRESS-2
068400                         COMPRESS-4A
068500                         COMPRESS-6
068600                         COMPRESS-PCM
068700                         COMPRESS-ITM
068800                         COMPRESS-DESC
068900                         COMPRESS-SSA
069000                         COMPRESS-REQ
069000                         COMPRESS-REQN
069100                         COMPRESS-LOT
                               COMPRESS-CHAT.
069300     MOVE CHAR-5PI    TO STRIP.
069400     MOVE STRIP       TO EXPAND-1.
           MOVE IBM-DOUBLE-WIDE-OFF TO STRIP.
           MOVE STRIP       TO EXP-1-OFF.
069500     MOVE CHAR-10PI   TO STRIP.
069600     MOVE STRIP       TO NORMAL-1A
069700                         NORMAL-2
