110400 200-GET-DPOFREIGHT.
           MOVE SPACES TO SAVE-PACK-SLIP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MISC-RS-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPOFREIGHT-REC.
           START DPOFREIGHT KEY = PORCVNO OF DPOFREIGHT-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2" OR FILE-STATUS = "00"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
