DCR01      INITIALIZE BUF-MREQ.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE REQ-ARG TO REQNO OF MREQ-REC.
           READ MREQ INTO BUF-MREQ
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
